# The test suite ships whole in the source package, helpers included.
# setuptools takes only the files named test*.py of its own accord, and since
# 0.6.4 fifteen of them import tests/signing.py, so pytest in an unpacked
# package could not collect them. The live tests import tests/live_pace.py.
include tests/*.py
# And the vectors they read: test_domain_keys.py and test_domain_fetch.py have
# nothing to run without them.
include tests/*.json
# The add-on is a distribution of its own, built from addons/domain-keys, and not in this one.
prune addons
